#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:15
msgid "Wipe"
msgstr "Odkryť"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:17
msgid ""
"The composition type **Wipe** is a transition. For the duration of the "
"composition in the timeline the clips are transitioned according to the "
"selected wipe method. It works similar to the Luma composition type / "
"transition."
msgstr ""
"Typ kompozície **Wipe** je prechod. Po dobu trvania kompozície na časovej "
"osi sa klipy prechádzajú podľa zvolenej metódy wipe. Funguje podobne ako typ "
"kompozície Luma / prechod."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Luma** and **Dissolve** transitions direct here because they are "
"essentially doing the same thing: use a greyscale image to transition from "
"one clip to the other. They have two additional parameters: :guilabel:`Use "
"transparency` and :guilabel:`Make padding transparent`."
msgstr ""
"Prechody **Luma** a **Dissolve** smerujú sem, pretože v podstate robia to "
"isté: používajú obrázok v odtieňoch šedej na prechod z jedného klipu do "
"druhého. Majú dva dodatočné parametre: :guilabel:`Použiť priehľadnosť` a :"
"guilabel:`Spraviť výplň priehľadnou`."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:21
msgid ""
"The **Wipe** transition by default performs a simple dissolve. You can "
"select a different Wipe Method, download from KDE Store, or use a file from "
"your local file system."
msgstr ""
"Prechod **Wipe** štandardne vykonáva jednoduché rozpustenie. Môžete vybrať "
"inú metódu Wipe, stiahnuť ju z obchodu KDE Store alebo použiť súbor z "
"lokálneho súborového systému."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:30
msgid "Settings for the Wipe transition"
msgstr "Nastavenia prechodu Wipe"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:32
msgid "Select the composition type"
msgstr "Vyberte typ kompozície"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:33
msgid ""
"Select the composition track. **Automatic** uses the track immediately "
"below. Only tracks with lower numbers can be selected."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte stopu kompozície. **Automaticky** použije stopu bezprostredne "
"nižšie. Vybrať možno iba stopy s nižšími číslami."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:34
msgid "Select the Wipe Method"
msgstr "Vyberte metódu Wipe"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:35
msgid ""
":doc:`Download and install </compositing/transitions/add_transitions>` new "
"Wipe Methods from the KDE Store"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Stiahnite a nainštalujte </compositing/transitions/add_transitions>` "
"nové metódy Wipe z obchodu KDE Store"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:36
msgid ""
"Set the softness (:abbr:`feathering (Smoothing or blurring the edges of a "
"feature)`) of the wipe method. Setting :guilabel:`Softness` to zero creates "
"a sharp edge between the two clips."
msgstr ""
"Nastavte jemnosť (:abbr:`feathering (Vyhladzovanie alebo rozmazávanie "
"okrajov prvku)`) metódy wipe. Nastavenie :guilabel:`Softness` na nulu "
"vytvorí ostrý okraj medzi dvoma klipmi."

#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:37
msgid "Check to invert the direction of the wipe method"
msgstr "Zaškrtnite pre invertovanie smeru metódy wipe"

#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:38
msgid "Check to reverse the direction of the wipe method (flips the clips)"
msgstr "Zaškrtnite pre otočenie smeru metódy wipe (prevráti klipy)"

