#: ../../compositing/transitions/wipe.rst:57
msgid ""
"This is a simple dissolve transition between the two tracks. The :guilabel:"
"`Softness` slider has no effect."
msgstr ""
"Toto je jednoduchý prechod rozpustenia medzi dvoma stopami. Posuvník :"
"guilabel:`Softness` nemá žiadny efekt."

